{"id":"df78b73a12becb80","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core.md","title":"ZFC Inner Fine Structural Core","display":"df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core — ZFC Inner Fine Structural Core","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core — ZFC Inner Fine Structural Core","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-fine-structural-core — ZFC Inner Fine Structural Core"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67304db766f65ebb\" href=\"?note=67304db766f65ebb\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68012bc8b343417a\" href=\"?note=68012bc8b343417a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bad389fa2bf413d7\" href=\"?note=bad389fa2bf413d7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md\">58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0494a2630c9bee7c\" href=\"?note=0494a2630c9bee7c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fb0405497b16b145\" href=\"?note=fb0405497b16b145\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\vec E\\in V\">\\(M,\\vec E\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"67304db766f65ebb\" href=\"?note=67304db766f65ebb\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\rho,\\vec p\\in V\">\\(\\vec\\rho,\\vec p\\in V\\)</span> are set-coded omega sequences</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S\\)</span> are the fine-structural parameter predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,M,L,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,M,L,\\Phi)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(C,A,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(C,A,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> are the exact predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCoreData}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCoreData}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCore}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCore}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structural\\text{-}core\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCoreData}_S(C,M,\\vec E,\\vec\\rho,\\vec p,\\mathcal F,L,\\Phi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\rho,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\rho))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec p,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec p))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,M,L,\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\vec\\rho(n),M,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(\\vec p(n),M,n)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\!\\left(\nC,\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec\\rho(n)\\right)\\cup\\{\\vec p(n):n\\in\\omega\\},\\mathcal F\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structural\\text{-}core\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCoreData}_S(C,M,\\vec E,\\vec\\rho,\\vec p,\\mathcal F,L,\\Phi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7FineStructuralModel}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\rho,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\rho))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec p,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec p))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,M,L,\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\vec\\rho(n),M,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(\\vec p(n),M,n)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\!\\left(\nC,\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec\\rho(n)\\right)\\cup\\{\\vec p(n):n\\in\\omega\\},\\mathcal F\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structural\\text{-}core}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCore}_S(C,M,\\vec E,\\vec\\rho,\\vec p,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists L,\\Phi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCoreData}_S(C,M,\\vec E,\\vec\\rho,\\vec p,\\mathcal F,L,\\Phi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structural\\text{-}core}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCore}_S(C,M,\\vec E,\\vec\\rho,\\vec p,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists L,\\Phi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerFineStructuralCoreData}_S(C,M,\\vec E,\\vec\\rho,\\vec p,\\mathcal F,L,\\Phi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence arguments are genuine set functions, and the Skolem-function family now receives its required language and formula-code set. The six-argument form is retained as an existential projection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"67304db766f65ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md","status":"resolved","id":"68012bc8b343417a","anchor":"ref-2"